# Play test of Balboa Remade (CIPlay balboa_remade, in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in its recipe: the rangers'
# station on the east terrace (5 m), the den's mouth on the west plateau facing east (8.9 m), the summit (50 m).
island Balboa Remade
expect step 0
expect title The Rangers' Last Call

# Up from the east beach to the station: the logbook, the machete
at 110 3
walk 110 3 to 100 3 to 93 4 h=5
zone station
expect step 1
read Ranger's logbook
expect step 2
open Tool locker
expect story machete 1
expect step 3

# The strongbox stays shut without its key
open Ranger's strongbox
expect message The strongbox is locked
expect step 3

# The den on the west plateau: the vines over the barricade cut with the machete, in to the Mama bear
at -52 -9.5
walk -52 -9.5 to -62 -9.5 h=8.9
use vinewall
expect message machete bites
expect hidden vinewall
walk -62 -9.5 to -70 -9.5 to -78 -9.5
zone den
expect step 4
kill Bear
expect step 5
open Hendricks' pack
expect story stationkey 1
expect step 6

# The summit: the radio called, its desk opened
at 26 -18
walk 26 -18 to 22 -17 h=50
zone summit
open Radio desk
expect message Call out first
use mastradio
expect message We hear you
open Radio desk
expect step 7

# Back at the station: the strongbox on the terrace north of the shack
at 82 15
open Ranger's strongbox
expect item Blueprint_Machete 1
expect item Blueprint_Fueltank 1
expect done
